      <Text style={{ fontFamily: "'Microsoft YaHei'", fontSize: 14, color: '#4A5568', marginBottom: 8 }}>拒答子集</Text>
    </Box>
    <Text style={{ fontFamily: "'Microsoft YaHei'", fontSize: 13, color: '#8B97A8', marginBottom: 18 }}>_abs 17/30 → 24/30，三轮逐题不差</Text>
    <Box style={{ borderLeft: '3px solid #1E4FA8', paddingLeft: 12, marginBottom: 14 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontFamily: "'Microsoft YaHei'", fontSize: 14, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>
        四道专名触发题全部翻对：Shinjuku / 30-gallon / Pete / Porsche。
